sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Unity Client<br/>(BuildingWebSocketClient)
    participant S as ASGI Server<br/>(BuildingEnergyConsumer)
    participant R as Redis<br/>(Channel Layer)

    Note over C,S: Phase 1: TCP + TLS Handshake
    C->>S: HTTP GET /ws/buildings/08417008/<br/>Upgrade: websocket
    S-->>C: HTTP 101 Switching Protocols

    Note over C,S: Phase 2: JWT Authentication
    C->>S: {"type":"authenticate","token":"eyJ..."}
    S->>S: AccessToken(token) — validate signature and expiry
    S->>R: group_add("buildings_08417008", channel_name)
    S-->>C: {"type":"auth_ok"}

    Note over C,S: Phase 3: Steady-State Operation
    
    loop Every 30 seconds
        C->>S: {"type":"ping"}
        S-->>C: {"type":"pong"}
    end

    Note over S: External edit triggers post_save
    S->>C: {"type":"building_updated","data":{...}}
    C-->>S: {"type":"ack","gml_id":"DEBW..."}

    S->>C: {"type":"building_deleted","gml_id":"DEBW..."}
    C-->>S: {"type":"ack","gml_id":"DEBW..."}

    Note over C,S: Phase 4: Graceful Disconnect
    C->>S: WebSocket Close Frame (1000)
    S->>R: group_discard("buildings_08417008", channel_name)
    S-->>C: Close Frame ACK
